    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173209",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GLOUCESTER.\nWhy, what, I pray, is Margaret more than that?\nHer father is no better than an earl,\nAlthough in glorious titles he excel.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173209/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173209/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173209/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173209/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 134,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2258896,
        "end": 2259070,
        "line": 82828,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@173209",
        "anchor": "sceneV_12.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GLOUCESTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SUFFOLK.\nYes, my lord, her father is a king,\nThe King of Naples and Jerusalem;\nAnd of such great authority in France\nAs his alliance will confirm our peace,\nAnd keep the Frenchmen in allegiance.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-4",
          "start": 79,
          "end": 116,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-5",
          "start": 117,
          "end": 156,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173387/line-6",
          "start": 157,
          "end": 194,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2259074,
        "end": 2259318,
        "line": 82835,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@173387",
        "anchor": "sceneV_12.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SUFFOLK.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173635",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GLOUCESTER.\nAnd so the Earl of Armagnac may do,\nBecause he is near kinsman unto Charles.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173635/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173635/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173635/line-3",
          "start": 48,
          "end": 88,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2259322,
        "end": 2259445,
        "line": 82844,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@173635",
        "anchor": "sceneV_12.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GLOUCESTER.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173762",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "EXETER.\nBeside, his wealth doth warrant a liberal dower,\nWhere Reignier sooner will receive than give.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173762/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173762/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@173762/line-3",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 102,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2259449,
        "end": 2259586,
        "line": 82850,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@173762",
        "anchor": "sceneV_12.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "EXETER.",
