    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_12.5/p@176702",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SUFFOLK.\nThus Suffolk hath prevail’d; and thus he goes,\nAs did the youthful Paris once to Greece,\nWith hope to find the like event in love,\nBut prosper better than the Troyan did.\nMargaret shall now be queen, and rule the King;\nBut I will rule both her, the King, and realm.",
